        "raw": "[quote=\"Matchstickman\"]\n\nHire PlatinumWarlock to write something.\n\n[/quote]\n\nWow--I&#39;m flattered!&nbsp; Thanks for the vote of confidence!\n\nIn all reality, though, I got a chance to chat briefly with Christopher (and Craig) at Origins.&nbsp; I&#39;ve made a standing offer to work on any Dark Watch-type sourcebook (or, perhaps, an Extremiverse book).&nbsp; Note that there is no contract signed, no confirmation of such a book even existed--just an offer on my part that I&#39;d be willing and able to work on such a thing, if they needed freelance writers.\n\nFor that matter, I&#39;d happily offer up my &quot;Villain of the Day&quot; as a subsidiary rogues&#39; gallery, if there was interest in including a &#39;rogues gallery&#39; type sourcebook.\n",
