        "created_at": "2018-07-26T22:12:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For my scene trackers, I just use a stack of poker chips. Green, yellow, and red stacked nicely and visible to the players. It works really well for me and gives a nice visual presentation.</p>\n<p>(Plus, when the mission on Insula Primalis resulted in the heroes splitting up, I was able to grab a second set of chips and have two separate scenes!)</p>",
