        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"PlatinumWarlock\"]\n\nIn not-me related ideas, how about this:A series of interlocking plastic 1-inch tiles that you could lay flat on the table:&nbsp; maybe 8 green, 8 yellow, and 8 red in a pack.&nbsp; Using these, you can create a physical representation of the scene tracker, customizable as you need for the scene.&nbsp; Then, you could use either a pointer tracker (or maybe include a translucent token to sit on top of the tile) to display which segment of the scene the players are in.\n\n[/quote]\n\nHey, if you can snap &#39;em together, you could snap &#39;em apart, crumbling bridge style. Have miniatures representing the heroes to further hammer home the comparison! :V\n",
